HISTORY the ithaperture in order j can be found as                              HISTORY follows:lambda=array[*,0,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                         HISTORY (i-1)],flux=array[*,1,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                            HISTORY (i-1)],uncertainty=array[*,2,{j-min(orders)}*naps +                     HISTORY (i-1)],flag=array[*,3,{j-min(orders)}*naps + (i-1)].The spectra         HISTORY in the file(s) spectra0033.fits,                                        HISTORY spectra0034.fits,spectra0035.fits, spectra0036.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0037.fits,spectra0038.fits, spectra0039.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0040.fits,spectra0041.fits, spectra0042.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0121.fits,spectra0122.fits, spectra0123.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0124.fits,spectra0125.fits, spectra0126.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0127.fits,spectra0128.fits, spectra0129.fits,                    HISTORY spectra0130.fits werecombined using a robust weighted mean with         HISTORY a sigma threshold of8.  Aperture 1 modifications: The scale             HISTORY factors were determinedusing order 1 and are:                           HISTORY 0.9779885547071924, 0.8855783995457404,0.8438801068148623,              HISTORY 0.8146680212477301, 0.8665345693836317,0.8218215344051459,              HISTORY 0.8495714845396435, 0.48072603678582815,0.8019956640061366,             HISTORY 0.8288126941064063, 1.171482326532256,1.0963856357422825,               HISTORY 1.1255873936554786, 1.0230250756802026,1.0302744634902579,              HISTORY 1.1310590414832704, 1.079862836246307,1.2169553427811006,               HISTORY 1.162476453309493, 1.1795228875536274.                                  END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             